<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="d907b3d2">&lt;p&gt;
    SMART is a mnemonic device that can be used so goals, objectives or metrics are:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;S - Specific &lt;/strong&gt;or appropriately detailed so it is clear what the area of focus will
    be for the given goal, objective or metric
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;M - Measurable&lt;/strong&gt; in order to quantify progress and determine whether the goal, objective or metric was
    met
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;A - Achievable&lt;/strong&gt; or attainable such that it is possible to actually execute or complete
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;R - Relevant&lt;/strong&gt; so the goal, objective or metric is applicable given various factors such as needs,
    environment, etc.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;strong&gt;T - Time-bound&lt;/strong&gt; such that the time it will take to achieve the goal, objective or metric is
    clearly 
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
